.md
## Zero-lag saving
We redesigned the whole system on how your graphs, images, sound, dataset objects are flowing between the evaluation kernel, frontend and a server. You no longer need to wait for so-called *synchronization of objects*, the data is already there!


![](/attachments/424234-236.png)


In addition we improved our garbage collector for plots, graphics any kind of *heavy* objects. It acts in a few steps:
1. Silently marks anything not visible in the notebook as garbage
2. Scans though cells and finds all false positives (not visible, but still in-use)
3. Scans though all hidden, encoded objects and marks other false positives
4. Nukes the rest

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Zero-lag saving
We redesigned the whole system on how your graphs, images, sound, dataset objects are flowing between the evaluation kernel, frontend and a server. You no longer need to wait for so-called *synchronization of objects*, the data is already there!


![](/attachments/424234-236.png)


In addition we improved our garbage collector for plots, graphics any kind of *heavy* objects. It acts in a few steps:
1. Silently marks anything not visible in the notebook as garbage
2. Scans though cells and finds all false positives (not visible, but still in-use)
3. Scans though all hidden, encoded objects and marks other false positives
4. Nukes the rest

