## Crash reports and server logs
If the master kernel for any reasons crashes, a logs will be generated. In fact, you can always access logs from the top menu <small>Misc</small> - <small>Show logs</small> of WLJS desktop application


![](/attachments/Screenshot-2026-10-21-at-12.55.17%E2%80%AFPM-cfa.png)


