.md
## Fixed race conditions in MCP server
If you ever used WLJS with any coding agents you might have been noticed, that sometimes it had to redo the cell's editing due to some typos. In fact, it wasn't typos! It was a lagged cell state synchronization, which is no longer an issue in 3.2.0.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
